  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Efficiency in the Chinese Industry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project identified and advised energy efficiency projects in energy-intensive industries in China, such as, iron and steel, chemicals, cement and paper industries. The project also provided expert knowledge on energy efficiency to the relevant actors, which generated a sustainable impact beyond what can be achieved by the individual measures. The DEG Deutsche Investitions- und Entwicklungsgesellschaft GmbH evaluated appropriate funding for implementing the measures identified.</narrative>
  </description>
